    "name": "Dentist Booking API",
    "description": "Term project: Dentist Booking System (group HelloWorld).\n\nSelect the **Dentist Booking - Local** environment. Run **Auth → Register** then **Login (user)**; the login test script saves the JWT to `{{token}}`, and every request inherits `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` from the collection. Admin requests use `{{adminToken}}` (run **Login (admin)** after the seed data from T17 exists).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "49392220",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/49392220-9fc56686-cf14-4182-a050-c1d56af015d4?source=collection_link"
